    "do_what_you_enjoy" : {
      "comment" : "UI Element: Text Label. Purpose: A motivational phrase displayed as part of an animation demonstration. It swaps with another phrase when the user interacts with the animation container. Context: Animation screen, within the 'Matched Geometry Effect' example.",
