      "comment" : "UI Element: Part of an instructional Text view. Purpose: This is a phrase fragment that explains where to find the \"Dynamic Type\" setting. It will be combined with preceding text (\"Use \"), an icon, and a subsequent phrase (e.g., \"Accessibility Settings\") to form a complete sentence. Screen/Context: Appears on the \"Dynamic Type\" demonstration screen (DynamicTypeScreen).",
